# The model artifact IS committed, deliberately.
#
# It is a build output, and the instinct is to keep build outputs out of git. But this
# repository exists to distribute that output: a clone without it has a server and no
# model. The image bakes it in rather than mounting it, so the image tag fully describes
# what the service predicts.

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
.env
